script = ExtResource("3_tes8r")
sender = "Jenny"
subject = "Project Meetings"
body = "Hi,

Please see the directory below to help with orienting yourself to the Scheduller app.

[b]Green[/b]: Infrastructure Resource Allocation
[b]Blue[/b]: Company Portal* 
[b]Purple[/b]: Product Research and Development
[b]Yellow[/b]: eLearning Curriculum Design**
[b]Grey[/b]: Business Strategy Alignment

*This team is currently understaffed. As such, we would appreciate if these blocks do not abut on the calendar.

**Due to time zone differences, the eLearning team should be scheduled at or after 4pm.

Jenny
[i]Resource Alignment Strategist[/i]
Parallax"
